    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chronical is a single-player puzzle-platforming game with gamepad controls only. The game contains 2-3 hours of gameplay with fresh new mechanics and puzzles you haven\u2019t seen before:\u00a0The power of time is at your fingertips! Take control of a powerful Chronomancer in this mysterious puzzle-platformer. Explore the Chronical school to discover its secrets and learn new spells. Will you save all of the professors and reveal the mystery of the Time Loop?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative puzzles and mechanics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 magic spells to master </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-3 hours of gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fascinating mysteries!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484810/extras/aa21345f7171eec5c2e63c120e596432.avif?t=1751124902\" /></span><br> This game was created by the class of 2022-2023 of Campus ADN, a school of videogame development in Montr\u00e9al, Qu\u00e9bec.</p>",
